  // -----------------------------------------------------------------------

  // Run two concurrent authenticated clients. In the mock, both clients use
  // the same subject (sub=1), so they should see the same calendars. To test
  // isolation, we need two different subjects. The mock only supports one
  // subject (sub=1), so we test that concurrent calls don't interfere with
